# Inclusion/Exclusion Criteria and Consort Diagram

* Inclusion/Exclusion Criteria for Analysis:
  + *Inclusion criteria*: Subjects from COVID households with at least one positive lab test result, and at least one PCC symptom variable at 90 day follow-up is not missing (i.e., followed up for 90-day PCC). 
 
  + *Exclusion criteria*: 
      - Specimens with no valid test result type or result (3 specimens are excluded, their cdc_specid/study_id are {506501001_02/506501, 609105102/609105, missing/709101}). 
      - Subjects from Flu households.  
      - Subjects from COVID households with no positive lab test result for COVID-19, or not followed up for 90-day PCC.
      - Subjects with abnormal health conditions (1 subject: study_id “724801”, an approximately 2-month old baby with 9 comorbidities).
  
  
