**Number of Clusters**: File is of length equal to nSweeps (the number of iterations of the MCMC after the burn in period). Each line corresponds to an iteration and it includes a single number, which is the number of clusters in that iteration. The number of clusters in the final iteration is found below.
```{r,  eval=FALSE, include=FALSE}
