```

**Number of Observations in Each Cluster**: Each line of this file corresponds to one iteration of the model. Each line gives the size of the cluster. The last number is the total number of observations clustered (ie the sum of all preceeding numbers in the line). The last line of this file is shown below.
```{r,results='hide'}
