# Summary

We identified the risk profiles of COVID-19 patients in the Respiratory Virus Transmission Network (RVTN) trial for the presence of PCC at 90 day follow-up. Based on the results from both Bayesian profile regression model and LCA, we pinpointed 5 statistically significantly different clusters of patients. Our research findings hold significant implications for the identification and subsequent intervention of COVID-19 patients at higher risk of developing Post-COVID Condition.


